{"unit_id":"tag:03PG:statement","translation":"<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平展覆盖（<ACCENT_0001>tale covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对应于概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>，是一个态射族（family of morphisms），其成员是概形（schemes）的态射<MATH_0002>，使得\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 每个<MATH_0003>为平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004>覆盖（cover）<MATH_0005>，即<MATH_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale covering","target_term":"平展覆盖"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"cover","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"étale covering","target_term":"平展覆盖","context":"定义术语。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"定义中的态射族。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"cover","target_term":"覆盖","context":"像覆盖目标。"}],"notes":[]}
