{"unit_id":"tag:03PH:proof","translation":"（另见《拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0001>。）设<MATH_0001>为平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering）。由于平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）平坦（flat），且覆盖（covering）中的元素（elements）应覆盖（cover）其目标（target），因此性质fp（忠实平坦（faithfully flat））得到满足。为检查性质qc（拟紧（quasi-compact）），设<MATH_0002>为仿射开集（affine open），并写成<MATH_0003>，其中<MATH_0004>为一些仿射开集（affine opens）。由于<MATH_0005>是开（open）的（因为平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）态射（morphisms）是开（open）的），可见<MATH_0006>是开（open）覆盖（covering），对应于<MATH_0007>。进一步，由于<MATH_0008>拟紧（quasi-compact），这个覆盖（covering）具有有限（finite）加细（refinement）。\n","allowed_english":["fp","qc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"cover","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"affine opens","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"cover","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖目标。"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标","context":"态射目标。"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"affine opens","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开","context":"态射及覆盖性质。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细","context":"覆盖的加细。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03PF:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n因此，对fpqc覆盖（fpqc coverings）为真的任意陈述，<TEXTITOPEN_0001>更当然<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>对平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（coverings）仍为真。例如，平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（site）是次典范（subcanonical）的。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"次典范"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"次典范","context":"景的性质。"}],"notes":[]}
